menuconfig ARCH_UMS9117
	bool "Unisoc UMS9117/T117"
	depends on ARCH_MULTI_V7
	select ARM_GIC
	select CLKSRC_MMIO
	select SPRD_TIMER
	help
	  Minimal Device Tree support for RAM-booted UMS9117/T117 systems:
	  a single Cortex-A7 with a GIC-400 behind ARCH_MULTI_V7. The port
	  lets most peripheral blocks adopt state left by the BootROM/FDL
	  download path. The Nokia TA-1618 USB peripheral profile is a narrow
	  exception: it explicitly reinitializes its controller, PHY and USB
	  3.3 V supply. The 1 ms AP system counter provides the clocksource,
	  the 32 kHz AON timer the clockevent, and the ARM architected timer
	  stays disabled because it reads zero on this SoC.
